Z||000005||sparks||08-16-2001||10:30 AM||||Yes, we'll see I suppose.  I doubt they could've noticed it when I took it in though, they only drove it from the street into the shop, I drove it out.  I didn't notice it until I was at highway speeds.<P>They seem like a decent bunch so I don't know what they'll say or do.<P>------------------<BR><BR>Adam Sparks||||reg||1
